{"completed": true, "response": "{\"more_loop\":\"X\",\"x_loops\":[\"S02-S05：在“舍不得从前的好/亲近”与“提醒自己受过委屈、怀疑当初该不该走”之间反复摆；S03、S04尤其接近，都是因亲近而心软，随后又转回对离开的怀疑。\",\"S06-S08：S06刚从回忆亲近得到暖意，S07因未来孤单又慌并想回头，S08又回到“想起有人在身边→暖一下→心再悬起来”；S08基本回到S06-S07已经到过的情绪位置，没有新增判断。\"],\"y_loops\":[\"S02-S05：同样在“怀念从前的好”与“受过的气不能忽略、是否走错”之间来回，S03-S04有较明显的重复摆动。\",\"S06-S08：也有“暖起来→因孤单而慌→又暖起来”的回摆，但S08新增了“回忆没法在现实难处中陪着他”这一层认识，所以比X更像往深处走。\"],\"why\":\"两条总体结构几乎相同，但X的S08更像把S06-S07的暖与慌原样再走一遍；Y在同一处加入了“回忆不能替代现实陪伴”的新认识，后面的S09-S10也因此衔接得更像继续辨认自己真正缺的是什么。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "35dfa197-112a-492d-a6f7-67e2a967d7e7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T073345166569Z", "elapsed_seconds": 12.688, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:33:57.871275+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5eb9bcf15f21a89bec18fe78b9ccaaf7430b8a428c1164b8e76d55bdd4e26087", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3